{"beat": 6, "name": "WHAT TO DO", "text": "A short list, and you can do all of it this week. First, before you copy anyone, ask for the denominator. How many people ran this plan, and how many of them are not on the podcast. If nobody can answer, treat the advice as a story, not a method. Next, look for the shared moves. If the winners and the losers did the same thing, that thing is not the explanation, however confidently it's told. Last, run your own plan more than once. Take your last year, change nothing but the order the demand arrived in, and see how wide the spread gets. If it's wide, most of what you'd credit to skill is variance, and the plan should be judged on its worst tenth, not its best.", "provider": "library", "words": [{"word": "A", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.128}, {"word": "short", "start": 0.197, "end": 0.418}, {"word": "list,", "start": 0.464, "end": 0.964}, {"word": "and", "start": 1.115, "end": 1.358}, {"word": "you", "start": 1.44, "end": 1.509}, {"word": "can", "start": 1.567, "end": 1.672}, {"word": "do", "start": 1.718, "end": 1.811}, {"word": "all", "start": 1.892, "end": 2.078}, {"word": "of", "start": 2.125, "end": 2.171}, {"word": "it", "start": 2.241, "end": 2.345}, {"word": "this", "start": 2.415, "end": 2.612}, {"word": "week.", "start": 2.694, "end": 3.135}, {"word": "First,", "start": 3.738, "end": 4.354}, {"word": "before", "start": 4.47, "end": 4.795}, {"word": "you", "start": 4.83, "end": 4.899}, {"word": "copy", "start": 4.957, "end": 5.224}, {"word": "anyone,", "start": 5.271, "end": 5.944}, {"word": "ask", "start": 6.118, "end": 6.397}, {"word": "for", "start": 6.444, "end": 6.548}, {"word": "the", "start": 6.594, "end": 6.664}, {"word": "denominator.", "start": 6.722, "end": 7.535}, {"word": "How", "start": 7.976, "end": 8.139}, {"word": "many", "start": 8.173, "end": 8.348}, {"word": "people", "start": 8.406, "end": 8.754}, {"word": "ran", "start": 8.812, "end": 9.009}, {"word": "this", "start": 9.056, "end": 9.172}, {"word": 